      "blurb": "Bakuton: Clay Dragon",
      "biography": "<p><em>Explosion Release: Clay Dragon (Bakuton Hijutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as an Action or Bonus action.</p><p><strong>Armor Class</strong> 16 + your ninjutsu ability modifier · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 60 + 25 for every rank above A-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft. flying</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +5 (save +11), DEX +4 (+10), CON +5 (+11), INT −5, WIS +0, CHA −5. <strong>Damage Vulnerability</strong> Lightning. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Acid, Poison, Psychic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Stunned, Exhaustion. <strong>Senses</strong> Relies on Caster senses.</p><p><strong>DR</strong> 6. <strong>Jutsu Slots</strong> 4.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its AC (base + your Ninjutsu ability modifier), hit points (by the rank you cast the jutsu at), Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC, and your senses.</p>",
      "summonRole": "Clay Dragon"
